{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0624_1000_p", "source_sha256": "415cf7277b278cb0d37c877b9c86c3cb677cea53b0c93b04df91070e69fa9eff", "ja": "（環のソロ曲のPV撮影が終わった。環の提案で、\n環の子分……ネコの『こぶん』も撮影に参加した）", "zh": "（环的个人曲PV拍摄结束了。在环的提议下，她的小弟……名叫“小弟”的猫也参加了拍摄）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0624_1001_040tam", "source_sha256": "0f0bb82bcad3a7aa3dd19c759d8169c8c2ce8310b9611ce40a19b57d7ac5cd76", "ja": "おやぶ～ん！　こぶんにごほうびあげてきたぞ～！\n今はね、スタッフの人たちと遊んでるよ。", "zh": "老大～！我去给小弟奖励啦～！\n现在啊，正和工作人员们一起玩呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0624_1002_p", "source_sha256": "1c5585992175b6c667bdfd492243a9191fe51f5a65239671d592989f5af0091f", "ja": "ははっ、大人気だな。\n撮影中も、こぶんは大活躍だったからな。", "zh": "哈哈，真受欢迎啊。\n拍摄的时候，小弟也大显身手了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0624_1003_040tam", "source_sha256": "ba1220d657fe6f477b8412a55bfd2546ccb4924d5eacf1a419619cd204c98857", "ja": "うん！　こぶんがいたから、たまきも楽しかった！\nこぶんもすっごく楽しそうだったぞ……くふふ♪", "zh": "嗯！因为有小弟在，环也玩得很开心！小弟看起来也特别开心……嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0624_1004_040tam", "source_sha256": "8a0b0103cd5f4b0bb94e0d530bfce7f75d51e27e0ba997a69a90e56a01fc2364", "ja": "おやぶん、ありがとう。こぶんと撮影したいって\n言った時、いろんな人にお願いしてくれたんだよね？", "zh": "头领，谢谢你。之前我说想和小弟一起拍照时，你拜托了很多人帮忙，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0624_1005_p", "source_sha256": "7d8bae50e7942d09594211590ad9ae33771f6a77a24494c7c344a8efa3a302b7", "ja": "どういたしまして。\n……というか、お礼をいうのは、こっちの方だ。", "zh": "不客气。\n……该道谢的，应该是我才对。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0624_1006_p", "source_sha256": "8787d908dc6460299f9c450016edf084e6a63cff0960a31aaa42587f3bb9fcd0", "ja": "PVもグッと良くなったし、現場の雰囲気も\n明るくなったし……それもこれも、環のおかげだな。", "zh": "PV变得精彩了许多，现场的气氛也\n变得更活跃了……这一切都是多亏了环啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0624_1007_040tam", "source_sha256": "8e0b8c8e01ed734a27a43b5d70ba64b1b94d26f990f1fac32b8e6e960cb5c85f", "ja": "たまきの？　こぶんじゃなくて？", "zh": "是环的？不是小弟的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0624_1008_p", "source_sha256": "9e460178ea7c91a50c2a2782c8ae89c8410aa4cd3442254f0ecda65464f23077", "ja": "ああ。ほら、現場に入った時。こぶんが\nちょっと緊張してただろ？　あの時、たまきが……。", "zh": "嗯。你看，刚到现场的时候，小弟不是有点紧张吗？那时候，环她……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0624_1009_040tam", "source_sha256": "8323cc45eac4243510ce894e20a7e91f6f8d5d3c213a3d7f2058f4b2ec56ed4f", "ja": "765プロの大神環とネコのこぶんです！\nよろしくおねがいします！", "zh": "我是765艺能的大神环和小猫小弟！\n请多指教！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0624_1010_040tam", "source_sha256": "4a992b3a5a80bab5422690df052e7d20d90428a4513dee94e09b66b83d7d882b", "ja": "あのね、こぶん！　ここにいる人たちは、こぶんや\nたまきと遊んでくれる、優しいスタッフさんだよ！", "zh": "那个啊，小弟！这里的人都是会陪小弟和环一起玩的温柔工作人员哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0624_1011_040tam", "source_sha256": "75c3dd621a06dcc9f75f7a6bd836d4cf85a1bc44a1474786a5485a98d3bfc878", "ja": "みーんな、たまきとこぶんの友達だぞ！\nさあ、一緒にご挨拶しようね♪", "zh": "大家都是环和小弟的朋友哦！\n来，一起打个招呼吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0624_1012_kobun", "source_sha256": "776f6f61d3093b7726882f6b15e153eafce8be4c42a22d146879a12adc768c35", "ja": "……にゃ～♪", "zh": "……喵～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0624_1013_p", "source_sha256": "f8a9f5f350ac64fa4513aef039152679f5993c160360d1d2e8a80d3a96d26220", "ja": "環が、スタッフさんを友達にしてくれたから\nこぶんも安心できたと思うんだ。", "zh": "因为环把工作人员变成了朋友，我想小弟也就能安心了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0624_1014_040tam", "source_sha256": "13f20d7b1027c86804f4bd902077dd0f6b78eab802113f3d86371cfdb0f59cb3", "ja": "そうなの……？\nたまきは、こぶんと挨拶しただけだよ？", "zh": "是这样吗……？\n环只是和小弟打了个招呼而已呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0624_1015_p", "source_sha256": "2de2d2824272236b298858d133d7add39029cbaed10411f84c35177d69834912", "ja": "ははっ、そうだな。でもそのおかげで、\nスタッフさん達もこぶんに接しやすくなったんだ。", "zh": "哈哈，说得也是。不过也正因为这样，工作人员们也更容易和小弟相处了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0624_1016_040tam", "source_sha256": "589d93623a693cb77a7cb92914945f855a779a57504a0d7c44fbb23aa74a1133", "ja": "？　よくわかんないけど……\nたまきが、仲良くなるお手伝いをしたってこと？", "zh": "？虽然不太明白……也就是说，环帮忙让大家变得要好了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0624_1017_p", "source_sha256": "283827210907c9ed235c7c72c7801adf52886be27ebfdb4d7fde05846c5201f6", "ja": "そういうことだな。偉かったな、環！", "zh": "就是这样。环，你做得很棒！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0624_1018_040tam", "source_sha256": "b0f8da2a1f0351199119194fac7ecea350e8a47a6b8780991e07b3ebe53ef6fd", "ja": "そっか～♪　ねぇねぇおやぶん……\nちょっとだけ、こぶんと遊んできていい？", "zh": "这样啊～♪　呐呐，大叔……\n我可以去和小弟玩一会儿吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0624_1019_p", "source_sha256": "478cf427884739f2d4165a68b80aaa13e813e8fe6523a37d24e4f29a5b306313", "ja": "ああ、大丈夫だよ。\nと言っても、帰る支度があるから程々にな。", "zh": "啊，没问题。\n不过还得收拾东西准备回去，所以适可而止哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0624_1020_040tam", "source_sha256": "34620a154493b6e3a64165aaf0208c9e4b79de4359aa7ee09b254ddaebebcdd2", "ja": "はーい！　あのね、さっきスタッフさんが、オモチャ\n持ってきてくれたんだ！　こぶんちゃんにって。", "zh": "好——！那个，刚才工作人员把玩具拿过来了！说是给小弟的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0624_1021_040tam", "source_sha256": "d623c37e75ccc4e59c71540a80bc191cdc93566bd26f776b842f0321bf13d732", "ja": "こぶん、すっごくがんばったし、みんなと遊んだら\nぜったいに喜ぶぞ～！　くふふ♪", "zh": "小跟班这么努力了，和大家一起玩的话，\n肯定会很开心的哦～！嘻嘻♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0624_1022_p", "source_sha256": "7a95ae11889dc07a007494ed046fe8e8d7566addbd86eeb2e61313be42c06680", "ja": "（環の周りには、いつも自然と笑顔が増えていく。\nこの才能を活かせるようにプロデュースしていこう！）", "zh": "（环的身边总是会自然而然地多出许多笑容。\n要好好进行制作，让她能够发挥这份才能！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
